2026-10-24T04:13:03.3220575Z Linux USB/IP device management (experimental preview)
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3220826Z 
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3220925Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3221085Z 
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3221156Z Commands:
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3221497Z   diagnostics         Export bounded private diagnostics without changing or stopping USB devices
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3222023Z   logs                Read sanitized stored logs or authorized agent audit projections
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3222531Z   agent               Run or query the nonroot shared application service using fixed profiles
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3223377Z   secure-server       Serve configured devices with mandatory mutual TLS and per-device authorization
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3224045Z   secure-discover     Read the stable-key device catalog over the configured mutually authenticated TLS endpoint
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3224721Z   secure-attach       Import the configured stable device key and own its encrypted VHCI relay until stopped
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3225346Z   native-pending      Inspect unresolved secure Native channels through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3225960Z   native-reconcile    Verify a stopped Native channel and retire its record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3226559Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3227178Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3227856Z   physical-server     Serve explicitly authorized whole USB devices through Linux USBFS (experimental, no TLS)
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3228527Z   virtual-server      Serve two virtual test devices; this experimental mode provides no authentication or TLS
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3229170Z   devices             Scan local devices without changing drivers. Discovery is not compatibility validation
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3229763Z   doctor              Read installed tool, module and helper capabilities without loading modules
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3230328Z   discover            Query a server's USB/IP device list over an administrator-managed trusted network
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3230924Z   export              Export an administrator-allowlisted device fingerprint via the privileged helper
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3231476Z   unexport            Release an allowlisted export and request local driver reattachment
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3231979Z   attach              Import a remote bus ID through an allowlisted endpoint and Linux VHCI
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3232428Z   detach              Disconnect an authorized local VHCI port (0..255)
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3233019Z   sessions            Read authoritative native kernel session state through the helper
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3233432Z   status              Query helper and kernel status
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3233795Z   help                Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3234053Z 
2026-10-24T04:13:03.3234125Z Options:
